le Angering SCP-096\n-Faster SCP-106 Door Movement\n-Disable Fall Damage\n-Contain 106 Immediately\n-Toggle, Cancel, and Activate Nuke Immediately\n-See Nuke Info and Time\n\nVISUAL\n-Player Esp\n-Item Esp\n-Reticle\n-Checkpoints, Elevators, and Gates ESP\n-Disable Flashbang Effects\n-Fullbright\n-Debug View\n\nTEAM/SHOP\n-See your Credits\n-See your currently Queued team\n-See all team's timers.\n\nPLAYER\n-Walk Speed and Jump Height\n\nSHORTCUTS\n-Quick Use Medkit Keybind (H)\n-Quick Use SCP-018 Ball Keybind (B)\n\nDEBUG\n-Infinite Yield\n-Rejoin\n-Reset\n-Panic/Destroy Gui\n-Reload Script","tags":["scp","scp demo","scp demonstration"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"62bc240f0be5f7371b24c5ec","username":"Aliz","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"62bc240f0be5f7371b24c5ec","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T02:41:43.464Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69b567c743eb3299c5e4474d","editBy":{"_id":"62bc240f0be5f7371b24c5ec","username":"Aliz","status":"offline","id":"62bc240f0be5f7371b24c5ec"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-03-14T13:51:03.828Z"},{"_id":"69b6696510fe3271a4bdad58","editBy":{"_id":"62bc240f0be5f7371b24c5ec","username":"Aliz","status":"offline","id":"62bc240f0be5f7371b24c5ec"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-03-15T08:10:13.535Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69b57beb4024e4a18df14649","commentBy":{"_id":"672a6badb499f2ddd6863600","username":"kntkontor","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2024-11-05T19:02:05.577Z","lastActive":"2026-10-13T17:44:07.470Z","lvl":6,"status"